      "text": "Giving future space missions a leg up. Or an arm, rather.\n\nRocket Lab Robotics developed a robotic arm with @NASA that can walk across spacecraft, use tools, and perform repairs and upgrades in orbit.\n\nIt launches on NASA's Fly Foundational Robots mission in late 2027. https://rocketlabcorp.com/updates/a-robotic-arm-that-can-walk-across-spacecraft-rocket-lab-built-it/",
