      "text": "🔧 CNC Programmers: https://bit.ly/3WbiF1G  Senior NZ based roles leading programming and setup for flight-critical aerospace components.  \n\n⚙️ CNC Operators: https://bit.ly/4Bu7TUk  NZ based roles that set up, run and inspect precision parts for rockets and spacecraft.  \n\n🌙 CNC Machinists (Multiple Shifts Available): https://bit.ly/4itrA61  Long Beach, CA based roles setting up and operating a fleet of advanced CNC machines to build flight-ready hardware.  \n\nExperience in aerospace, aviation, motorsports, marine or similar industries is ideal but not essential.",
